## Installation

### End Users

Download the latest `.exe` from [Releases](https://github.com/your-org/24-hour-digital-clock/releases).

### Developers

```powershell
pip install -e .
python -m clock_app
```

## Build

### Windows

```powershell
./build_exe.ps1
```

### macOS / Linux

```bash
./build_exe.sh
```

## Keyboard Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action |
| --- | --- |
| `Ctrl+Tab` | Next tab |
| `Ctrl+Shift+Tab` | Previous tab |
| `Ctrl+N` | Add alarm |
| `Ctrl+M` | Toggle compact mode |
| `Ctrl+Shift+T` | Minimize to tray |
| `F11` | Start/exit screensaver |

